              "Lead trade negotiators from both the United States and Chine are expected to speak by telephone on Friday as Ross prepared separately to travel to Asia for a three-day summit of Southeast Asian nations in Thailand.\n\n“There will some transactions announced -- some very good-sized transactions -- announced while I’m on this trip,” he said, but gave no other details.",
              "{\"headline\":\"Phase one trade deal with China is in good shape: U.S. Commerce Secretary\",\"dateCreated\":\"2019-11-01T11:54:45Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2019-11-01T19:04:33Z\",\"datePublished\":\"2019-11-01T11:54:45Z\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Reuters Staff\"},\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"Reuters\"},\"articleSection\":\"Business News\",\"creator\":[\"Reuters Staff\"],\"keywords\":[[\"US\",\"USA\",\"TRADE\",\"CHINA\",\"ROSS\",\"Agricultural Markets\",\"Aluminum\",\"Aluminum (TRBC level 4)\",\"Americas\",\"Association of Southeast Asian Nations\",\"Asia / Pacific\",\"Banks (TRBC level 4)\",\"China (PRC)\",\"Diplomacy / Foreign Policy\",\"Emerging Market Countries\",\"Metals Markets\",\"Major News\",\"Monetary / Fiscal Policy / Policy Makers\",\"Government / Politics\",\"US President\",\"Picture Available\",\"Soybean\",\"Steel\",\"Iron & Steel (TRBC)\",\"Technology (TRBC level 1)\",\"Thailand\",\"Reuters Top News\",\"International Trade\",\"Tariffs\",\"United States\",\"US Government News\",\"Western Europe\"]],\"about\":\"Article\"}"
